# Destinations offered to the Beeb by tools/gate.sh.
#
#   label  target
#
# label   what the menu shows, and what can be typed instead of the number
# target  an ssh destination, or "-" for a shell on the gateway itself
#
# The gateway authenticates with its own key and never asks the Beeb for
# a password (gate.sh refuses password and keyboard-interactive auth), so
# every target listed here must already accept this machine's public key:
#
#   ssh-copy-id user@target
#
# and must already be in this machine's known_hosts, or the first
# connection stops to ask about the host key over the Beeb's link. One
# ordinary ssh from a normal session settles that.

deskbox  -
self      user@localhost
